{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--58065", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"P12345ABC\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Smith\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\",\n        \"contact_info\": \"alice.smith@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 750000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1200.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"date\": \"2023-03-15\",\n            \"amount\": 5000.0,\n            \"description\": \"Water damage repair\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of potential losses. It includes detailed information on covered perils, exclusions, deductibles, and claim procedures. The policy covers damage to your property resulting from fire, theft, vandalism, and certain natural disasters.  It also includes liability protection in case someone is injured on your property. Specific limitations apply, and it’s crucial to read the complete policy document.  Details regarding dispute resolution, cancellation policies, and renewal procedures are outlined in sections 4, 5 and 6 respectively. The coverage extends to personal belongings and provides additional living expenses if your home becomes uninhabitable.  The policy will be renewed automatically unless you notify us in writing 30 days prior to the expiry date.\"\n}"}
