{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--61060", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"INS-2024-CAL-001\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 150000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1200.5,\n    \"claim_history\": [],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of incidents, including fire, theft, and liability.  It details specific exclusions related to natural disasters and pre-existing conditions. The policy outlines the claims process, including required documentation and timelines for resolution.  It also specifies the arbitration process in case of disputes. This coverage extends to accidental damage to property.  Details regarding deductibles are provided. Coverage includes personal belongings, and provides for legal defense costs.  Renewal terms are clearly stated, and any changes to the policy will be communicated in writing. This is a fully comprehensive policy designed to protect your assets and financial well-being. Additional terms relate to cancellation and premium adjustments. A complete list of covered perils is included.\"\n}"}
