{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--61093", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"POL2024-12345\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Smith\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact\": \"alice.smith@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 150000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1200.5,\n    \"claim_history\": [],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a range of potential incidents, including property damage, liability, and personal injury. It details exclusions, limitations, and the claims process thoroughly. The policy covers events like fire, theft, vandalism, and certain natural disasters. It also outlines the responsibilities of both the policyholder and the insurance provider.  A deductible of $500 applies to most claims. Please read the full terms and conditions document for a complete understanding of your coverage. This policy is subject to annual review and renewal. In the event of a dispute, arbitration will be the primary method of resolution. Coverage extends to additional living expenses in case of a covered loss rendering your home uninhabitable. The policy term is one year, renewable annually upon payment of premium.\"\n}"}
