{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--61337", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"POL12345\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 100000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1100.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for various risks including property damage, liability, and medical expenses. It details exclusions related to acts of war and intentional damage. The policy covers losses due to fire, theft, and vandalism. Deductibles apply, as outlined in section 3. The policy renews annually and can be canceled with 30 days' notice. The full terms and conditions are available upon request. This is a detailed explanation of coverage. We aim to provide peace of mind to our policyholders with clearly defined terms and conditions, ensuring transparency and understanding.  The policy also includes clauses related to dispute resolution and arbitration, ensuring a fair process for handling any disagreements. We strive to maintain high standards of customer service and are committed to resolving any issues promptly and efficiently.  This policy is governed by the laws of the State of California. Continued coverage requires timely premium payments.\"\n}"}
