{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--61768", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"POL2024-12345\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 150000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1200.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"CLM001\",\n            \"date\": \"2023-05-15\",\n            \"amount\": 5000.0,\n            \"description\": \"Vehicle damage due to hail\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for your vehicle, including collision, comprehensive, liability, and uninsured motorist protection.  Details on deductibles, exclusions, and claim procedures are provided below.  Coverage extends to damage caused by fire, theft, vandalism, and natural disasters. The policyholder is responsible for maintaining the vehicle in good working order and complying with all traffic laws.  Full terms and conditions are available upon request. This policy will cover any damages that result from accidents or natural disasters in compliance with state and federal laws. The claim process must begin within 30 days of the incident.  We will need a police report and at least two estimates to assess the damage.  Please refer to our website for a full description of frequently asked questions. The company reserves the right to deny a claim if found to be fraudulent.\"\n}"}
