{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--61975", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"POL-789456\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact_info\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 750000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1200.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a variety of potential risks, including property damage, liability, and loss of income. It includes detailed explanations of coverage limits, exclusions, and the claims process.  The policyholder is responsible for maintaining the property in good repair and notifying the insurer of any changes that could affect the risk.  Dispute resolution procedures are outlined, and the policy is subject to the laws of the state of California. This document explains all terms and conditions in full.  It also covers details about annual review, policy renewal, and potential cancellation conditions. This policy is a significant investment for your future. The complete policy terms are more than 200 words.  Renewal rates are subject to change.\"\n}"}
