{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--n--66135", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"P67890\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Bob Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"456 Oak Ave, New York, NY 10001\",\n        \"contact_information\": \"bob.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 60000.0,\n    \"premium\": 600.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"C001\",\n            \"date\": \"2023-03-15\",\n            \"amount\": 1000.0\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This insurance policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of events, including but not limited to fire, theft, vandalism, and certain natural disasters such as hurricanes, earthquakes, and floods. It outlines the responsibilities of both the insurer and the insured, detailing the claim filing procedures, the conditions under which coverage applies or is denied, and the process for dispute resolution. The policy also specifies the deductible amounts, coverage limits, and any exclusions to the coverage. Furthermore, it includes information about cancellation and renewal options, as well as the governing law and jurisdiction for any legal proceedings. The insurer reserves the right to amend these terms with prior written notice to the policyholder.\"\n}"}
