{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--67246", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"P7890123\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\",\n        \"contact_information\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 75000.0,\n    \"premium\": 450.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"C1001\",\n            \"date\": \"2023-03-15\",\n            \"amount\": 2500.0,\n            \"description\": \"Water damage repair\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of unforeseen events, including fire, theft, vandalism, and natural disasters. It outlines the responsibilities of both the policyholder and the insurance provider, detailing claim procedures, exclusions, and cancellation policies. Coverage extends to the structure of the property as well as personal belongings.  Detailed limitations and specifics regarding liability coverage are also outlined. The full terms and conditions can be found in the appendix. Disputes will be settled through arbitration as described in section 8. The policy is renewable annually and premiums are subject to adjustment based on risk assessment. (250+ words)\"\n}"}
