{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--67784", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"INS-2024-007\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\",\n        \"contact_information\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 120000.0,\n    \"premium\": 850.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"CLM-2023-001\",\n            \"date\": \"2023-05-15\",\n            \"amount\": 1500.0,\n            \"description\": \"Windstorm damage\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This insurance policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of unforeseen events, including fire, theft, vandalism, and natural disasters. It also includes liability protection in case of accidents. The policy covers the full replacement cost of damaged property without depreciation. Deductible amounts vary depending on the type of claim. Please read the complete policy document for detailed terms and conditions, exclusions, and limitations.  This policy is effective from January 1, 2024, to December 31, 2024 and is subject to annual renewal. We strive to provide excellent customer service.  Contact our claims department for any claim related enquiries. This is a detailed and extensive policy covering a variety of scenarios. Further details regarding specific incidents are outlined in section 4.  Additional terms apply...\"\n}"}
