{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--70458", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"CA-789456-2023\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Johnson\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Los Angeles, CA 90001\",\n        \"contact_information\": \"alice.johnson@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 100000.0,\n    \"premium\": 1100.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"CL-1234\",\n            \"date\": \"2022-10-15\",\n            \"amount\": 500.0,\n            \"status\": \"approved\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for a wide range of incidents including fire, theft, vandalism, and natural disasters.  Detailed conditions regarding deductibles, exclusions, and claim procedures are outlined in sections 1-15.  Specific limitations apply to certain types of jewelry and artwork, as detailed in Appendix A.  The policy is subject to annual review and may be amended with 30 days written notice.  Dispute resolution procedures are available through arbitration.  Full terms and conditions are available upon request and are a key part of this agreement. This policy also covers liability for accidental damage caused to third parties.\"\n}"}
