{"_id": "Finance_and_Economics--insurance_policy--p--70643", "text": "{\n    \"policy_id\": \"P123456789\",\n    \"policy_holder\": {\n        \"name\": \"Alice Smith\",\n        \"address\": \"123 Main St, Anytown, USA\",\n        \"contact_information\": \"alice.smith@email.com\"\n    },\n    \"coverage_amount\": 100000.0,\n    \"premium\": 850.0,\n    \"claim_history\": [\n        {\n            \"claim_id\": \"C001\",\n            \"date\": \"2023-03-15\",\n            \"amount\": 500.0,\n            \"description\": \"Water damage repair\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"policy_terms\": \"This policy provides comprehensive coverage for homeowners against fire, theft, vandalism, and various natural disasters. It outlines specific exclusions such as acts of war and certain types of flood damage. Deductibles apply as stated in Schedule A. The policy also details the claims process and required documentation. Cancellation policies are clearly stated. Updates to the policy will be provided in writing at least 30 days in advance. Coverage limitations are detailed in section 4.3. This policy is subject to the laws of the state of California.\"\n}"}
